      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Devastation [zone=339]\n**Who:**\n- Oathmir the Outcast [npc=20377]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Expedition\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 120:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Legion of Rage +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Zones:**\n- Razorthorn, Tower of Sullon Zek [zone=342]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Ghost, Guardian of Razorthorn [npc=21044]\n- Snowtail, Guardian of Razorthorn [npc=21301]\n- Sullon Zek, Mistress of Rage [npc=21051]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Access to Deathknell, Tower of Dissonance [quest=3397]\n- Become the Vessel (Razorthorn Access) [quest=3428]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** | 6\n**Max. # of Players:** | 54\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Apr 29 15:02:26 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _In order to request this expedition, you must have completed the Becoming the Vessel task (for Razorthorn access) and have looted three Legendary Berserker Bones (one from Devastation minis, one from Titanothon, and one from Sverag bosses). If that is done, Oathmir the Outcast will offer you this task._\nOathmir the Outcast says 'I [feel disconnected] from Her and without my rage and my desire I have nothing. I feel that you have a connection to Her or to Her rage. Perhaps you can enter Her tower and discover the source of the wrongness coming from Her home, find a way to [fix whatever is wrong]. Of course as powerful as you may be, you should not attempt to enter Her sancutary without a great force behind you.'\nYou say, 'We will fix whatever is wrong'\n_An expedition for Razorthorn, Tower of Sullon Zek opens -- a raid capped at 54 players._\n\n---\n\n_Enter Razorthorn through Sverag, Stronghold of Rage. Battle your way up the tower, clearing the werewolves, evil eyes, and raging spirits. Be advised that trash mobs in this zone have special abilities, whether AE spells, AE rampage, charm, or FD procs._\n_You'll encounter Ghost and Snowtail, the Guardians of Razorthorn, as well as Sullon Zek. All three have their own 5-day lockout._\n\n---\n\n**Ghost**\n_Ghost, Guardian of Razorthorn, hits for a max ~4,500; flurries; and enrages. Every 15% from 90% down, it summons a wave of five adds: 3x \"a raging werewolf destroyer\" (hits for ~2200; enrages; may flurry or single-target rampage) and 2x \"a raging werewolf vindicator\" (hits for ~2200; enrages; one will flurry; one will AE rampage for full damage)._\n_Ghost also has a significant damage shield (both spell and melee):_\nGhost's Guarding Aura: Single Target, Unresistable (0)\n2: Spell-Damage Shield(-1000)\n3: Increase Damage Shield by 225\n_It also casts \"Ghost's Vengeance\" on random people:_\nGhost's Vengeance: Single Target, Chromatic (-525)\n1: Increase Absorb Damage by 10000\n2: Decrease Hitpoints by 1000 per tick\n3: Trigger Effect: Ghost's Vengeance Doom on Fade\nGhost's Vengeance Doom: Area - PC Only 75', Unresistable (0)\n1: Decrease Spell Range by 99%\n2: Decrease HP when cast by 750\n3: Unknown #358 (100/-500/0)\n4: Decrease Endurance by 400\n5: Decrease Hitpoints by 750 per tick\n6: Decrease Mana by 500 per tick\n7: Decrease Endurance by 400 per tick\n8: Add Proc: Ghost's Vengeance Strike rate mod 500\nGhost's Vengeance Strike: Self, Unresistable (0)\n1: Shadowstep\n2: Root\n3: Decrease Hitpoints by 500 per tick\n\n---\n\n**Snowtail**\n_Snowtail, Guardian of Razorthorn, hits for a max ~4,500; single-target rampages; and enrages. It casts a charm on 3-5 random people every 90 seconds (giving them \"Snowtail's Rage Strike\" proc in the process):_\nSnowtail's Rage: Single Target, Unresistable (0)\n1: Charm up to level 99\n2: Add Proc: Snowtail's Rage Strike rate mod 100\n3: Decrease Mana by 350 per tick\n4: Decrease Endurance by 350 per tick\n5: Illusion: Werewolf\n6: Decrease Movement by 75%\n7: Increase Curse Counter by 45\n8: Decrease All Resists by 1000\nSnowtail's Rage Strike: PB AE 75', Chromatic (-500)\n2: Decrease HP when cast by 2500\n3: Decrease Hitpoints by 1500 per tick\n4: Stun(0.25 sec)\n5: Increase Disease Counter by 8\n_Starting at 90% and every 15% after, waves of 3x \"a raging werewolf destroyer\" spawn (max hit ~2,200; single-target rampage)._\n\n---\n\n**Sullon Zek**\n_Sullon Zek is located at the top of the tower. She is tethered and will DT for 5 million damage if pulled past the gate in her room. She hits for a max ~4,500 and single-target rampages._\n_Starting at about 87% and then every 12% health after, 4x \"a raging beholder\" (hit for ~2,200; rampage; flurry; unmezzable; unsnareable) spawn in the hallway leading to her room. They share aggro with Sullon Zek and will hunt you down regardless of your location._\n_The spell Sullon's Plague is cast on everyone every three minutes:_\nSullon's Plague: Targeted AE 125', Chromatic (-500)\n1: Decrease Spell Haste by 99%\n2: Decrease Attack Speed by 99%\n3: Decrease HP when cast by 4000\n4: Unknown #358 (100/-1500/0)\n5: Decrease Endurance by 1200\n6: Increase Disease Counter by 18\n_One of the three spells: \"Sullon's Ferocity\" or \"Sullon's Vengeance\" or \"Sullon's Wrath\" are cast on four random people every 90 seconds. These spells are VIRAL. After about 10 seconds, those who are inflicted with these spells will AE the same effect on all those around them (the range is large - about 300)._\nSullon's Ferocity: Single Target, Chromatic (-500)\n1: Invunerability\nSullon's Vengeance: Single Target, Unresistable (0)\n1: Stun(30.00 sec/70)\nSullon's Wrath: Single Target, Chromatic (-500)\n6: Decrease Effective Casting Level by 200\n7: Decrease Chance to Hit by 10000% with All Skills\n_Get through the above and kill Sullon Zek:_\nSullon Zek, Mistress of Rage has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nYour faction standing with Legion of Rage got better.\nSullon Zek, Mistress of Rage's corpse slumps to the ground, blood streaming from mortal wounds like scarlet ribbons. Her fiery eyes dim as the berserker fury fades to dull embers.\n_You receive the flag for this event by going down the trap door in Sullon's room and following the path all the way down to a platform (you'll know it when you see it). You must have the \"Shard of Mana\" on you to receive the proper flag. It will change into a \"Glowing Shard of Mana\" - see the Deathknell access quest [quest=3397] for more information._\n\n---\n\n**Loot**\nRandom Rare Zonewide Drop:\nBlood-fueled Ragestone (hp emphasis)\nBlood-fueled Ragestone (mana emphasis)\nSnowtail and Ghost (who share loot tables):\nBand of Seething Rage\nBlood-fueled Ragestone (hp emphasis)\nBlood-fueled Ragestone (mana emphasis)\nHoop of Seething Rage\nRagestone Adorned Amulet\nRagestone Adorned Earhoop\nRagestone Adorned Ring\nWristbands of Burning Rage\nWristcuffs of Burning Rage\nWristplates of Burning Rage\nWristwraps of Burning Rage\nSullon Zek:\nBattleworn Symbol of Rage\nRoughcut Band of Rage\nRoughcut Ragestone\nScorched Wand of Rage\nSpiked Cudgel of Rage\nSpiked Faceguard of Rage\nTattered Belt of Rage\n- Band of Seething Rage [item=48750]\n- Battleworn Symbol of Rage [item=48757]\n- Blood-Fueled Ragestone [HP emphasis]\n- Blood-Fueled Ragestone [Mana/Endurance emphasis]\n- Glowing Orb of Rage [item=48684]\n- Hoop of Seething Rage [item=48754]\n- Last Blood [item=45215]\n- Ragestone Adorned Amulet [item=52756]\n- Ragestone Adorned Earhoop [item=52754]\n- Ragestone Adorned Ring [item=48755]\n- Spiked Cudgel of Rage [item=48687]\n- Spiked Faceguard of Rage [item=48685]\n- Tattered Belt of Rage [item=48686]\n- Wristbands of Burning Rage [item=48753]\n- Wristplates of Burning Rage [item=48967]",
